      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '[W, A, S, D] - Move Character

    [SPACE / E] - Interact (Open Doors,
    Chests, Collect Keys & Bank Counter)

    [F] - Initiate Bank Heist Threat (When
    playing as Robber)

    [ESC] - Pause Game / Open Options Menu


    --- SQUAD
    TACTICAL COMMANDS (Robber & Police) ---

    [1] ATTACK / OPEN FIRE - Order teammates
    to engage enemies

    [2] THROW GRENADE - Order teammates to toss explosive
    bombs

    [3] RETREAT - Order teammates to fall back through the exit doors

    [4]
    REGROUP / FOLLOW - Order teammates to return to 3v3 formation'
