  m_text: '<size=50><b><color=#FFD700>THE GREAT BANK HEIST</color></b></size>


    <b>Created
    & Directed By</b>

    David Benyakov


    <b>Starring</b>

    The Commander
    (Player)

    Daniel & Max - The Heist Crew

    Sgt. Roi Levi & Officer Maya
    Cohen - SWAT Unit

    Alex - The Unlucky Bystander


    <b>Systems & Engineering</b>

    3v3
    Tactical NavMesh AI

    Multi-Scene Dynamic Pursuit

    Interactive Story &
    Role Scenarios


    <b>Thank You For Playing!</b>'
