    - target: {fileID: 5352390201875120053, guid: 648ead2f9c4fc40a6b87c9fd6c80f981, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '[W, A, S, D] - Move Character

        [SPACE / E] - Interact (Open
        Doors, Chests, Collect Keys & Bank Counter)

        [F] - Initiate Bank
        Heist Threat (When playing as Robber)

        [ESC] - Pause Game / Open
        Options Menu


        --- SQUAD TACTICAL COMMANDS (Robber & Police) ---

        [1]
        ATTACK / OPEN FIRE - Order teammates to engage enemies

        [2] THROW
        GRENADE - Order teammates to toss explosive bombs

        [3] RETREAT -
        Order teammates to fall back through the exit doors

        [4] REGROUP
        / FOLLOW - Order teammates to return to 3v3 formation'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
